WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand tall. Shift into the left foot and hug the right knee into the chest.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hold the right big toe (or a strap) and extend the right leg forward.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the standing leg strong and the hips level.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Optionally open the raised leg out to the side, then return to center.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release and switch sides.
